# TypeDecl entries must be type-checked and not skipped.
# Before S-1041, TypeDecl entries were skipped during inference, causing a panic
# when inferred_type was accessed. After the fix, TypeDecl entries get
# inferred_type_decl_id set during type checking and evaluate to the type dict.
[
  Color: [type Red Green Blue]
  Status: [type Ok Error]
  value: Color.Red
]
=== out
["Color": ["Red": []  "Green": []  "Blue": []]  "Status": ["Ok": []  "Error": []]  "value": []]
